{"id":"9a7da25a4fbbc78c","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-sacks-splitting.md","title":"Sacks 分裂与上锥回避","display":"thm-sacks-splitting — Sacks 分裂与上锥回避","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-sacks-splitting","aliases":["20-thm-sacks-splitting"],"display":"thm-sacks-splitting — Sacks 分裂与上锥回避","chapter":"7","section":"7.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 7.5.1；Lemma 7.5.7","source_printed_pages":[158,159,160],"source_pdf_pages":[192,193,194],"depends_on":["[[20-lem-ce-preservation]]","[[20-lem-splitting-lowness]]","[[20-thm-single-event-enumeration]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-low-high]]","[[20-df-join]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-sacks-splitting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-sacks-splitting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sacks-splitting — Sacks 分裂与上锥回避"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 7.5.1；Lemma 7.5.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>158</span><span>159</span><span>160</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>192</span><span>193</span><span>194</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"daa141317125dee0\" href=\"?note=daa141317125dee0\" title=\"20-lem-ce-preservation\">20-lem-ce-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"617ac90f851b7f95\" href=\"?note=617ac90f851b7f95\" title=\"20-lem-splitting-lowness\">20-lem-splitting-lowness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ec065689fdce567\" href=\"?note=8ec065689fdce567\" title=\"20-thm-single-event-enumeration\">20-thm-single-event-enumeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(B,C\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\notin\\mathcal R\">\\(C\\notin\\mathcal R\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"daa141317125dee0\" href=\"?note=daa141317125dee0\" title=\"20-lem-ce-preservation\">20-lem-ce-preservation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"617ac90f851b7f95\" href=\"?note=617ac90f851b7f95\" title=\"20-lem-splitting-lowness\">20-lem-splitting-lowness</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8ec065689fdce567\" href=\"?note=8ec065689fdce567\" title=\"20-thm-single-event-enumeration\">20-thm-single-event-enumeration</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\exists A_0,A_1\\in\\mathcal E\\ [A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing\\land A_0\\cup A_1=B\\land\n\\bigwedge_{i&lt;2}(\\operatorname{Low}_1(A_i)\\land C\\not\\le_TA_i)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\exists A_0,A_1\\in\\mathcal E\\ [A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing\\land A_0\\cup A_1=B\\land\n\\bigwedge_{i&lt;2}(\\operatorname{Low}_1(A_i)\\land C\\not\\le_TA_i)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 改为每阶段至多新增一个元素的可计算枚举，允许空步骤，因此有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 也适用。按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2e+i\">\\(2e+i\\)</span> 排列需求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^{A_i}\\ne\\chi_C\">\\(\\Phi_e^{A_i}\\ne\\chi_C\\)</span>，为每边计算 c.e. 保持策略的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_i(e,s),r_i(e,s)\">\\(\\ell_i(e,s),r_i(e,s)\\)</span>。当新元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，选择若枚举到对应边就会穿过限制的最高优先级需求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2e+i\">\\(2e+i\\)</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 放到另一边；没有这种需求则放到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0\">\\(A_0\\)</span>。每阶段判断只有有限多个非零限制，故规则可计算。</p>\n<p>按优先级归纳。固定需求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>，已知全部更高限制最终稳定；选超过它们的界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>，再等到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\upharpoonright R\">\\(B\\upharpoonright R\\)</span> 的枚举完成。此后若新元素威胁 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>，它不威胁任何更高需求，故规则把它放到另一边，不损伤 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>。保持引理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的回避结论和有限稳定限制，归纳完成。这样两边 c.e.、不交且并为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，并回避给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>最后对每边应用专门的低性测试引理：把输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 的对角停止编码为某个只在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 输出常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_C(0)\">\\(\\chi_C(0)\\)</span> 的程序，其一致长度的稳定 0/1 极限计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i&#39;\">\\(A_i&#39;\\)</span>。所以两边低。原稿“有限损伤验证同时给出低性”的跳步在此由该独立引理补足。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.5.1；Lemma 7.5.7；印刷页 158, 159, 160；PDF 第 192, 193, 194 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-lem-ce-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"daa141317125dee0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-ce-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-splitting-lowness","status":"resolved","id":"617ac90f851b7f95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-splitting-lowness]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-single-event-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"8ec065689fdce567","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-single-event-enumeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-ce-pre