]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-join]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,C\\in\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"C\\notin\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\exists A_0,A_1\\in\\mathcal E\\ [A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing\\land A_0\\cup A_1=B\\land\n\\bigwedge_{i<2}(\\operatorname{Low}_1(A_i)\\land C\\not\\le_TA_i)].","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"2e+i","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^{A_i}\\ne\\chi_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_i(e,s),r_i(e,s)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"2e+i","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"A_0","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"B\\upharpoonright R","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_C(0)","display":false},{"tex":"A_i'","display":false}],"bytes":2480,"backlinks":[{"id":"1013cc25d82f1ed8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-sacks-splitting]]；see [[20-prop-disjoint-ce-join]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。"},{"id":"1f0d77daa9699532","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-sacks-splitting]]；see [[20-prop-disjoint-ce-join]]；see [[20-df-halt]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]。"},{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"既有路线可继续阅读：动态枚举 [[20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting]]；反演与精确对 [[20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set]]、[[20-thm-exact-pair]]；有限损伤 [[20-thm-low-simple]]、[[20-thm-fm]]、[[20-thm-sacks-splitting]]；Δ₂ 扩展 [[20-thm-delta2-cone-avoidance]]、[[20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting]]；基定理 [[20-thm-low-basis]]、[[20-thm-superlow-basis]]；博弈 [[20-thm-banach-mazur]]、[[20